  "origin": "FermatMind independently authored bilingual frequency reflection using four familiar communication-behaviour categories;notRathus/SIS/validatedskilltest/DISC/MarkMurphySocialStylesorborrowedquestionbank.",
  "instructions": {
    "zh": "回顾近四周自己在日常协作、学习、工作或相处中的实际说法与回应，按出现频率选择。1从不到5几乎总是；没有适用经历、无法判断或不愿回答可以不计分。可以有多种方式，不必挑一个理想形象；也不要替他人判型。无需填写私人对话。",
    "en": "Think about how you actually spoke or responded in everyday cooperation, study, work or relationships over the past four weeks. Rate frequency from 1, never, to 5, almost always. Use the unscored option when no experience applies, you are unsure or you prefer not to answer. Several patterns can occur; do not choose an ideal image or classify someone else. No private conversation text is required."
  },
